Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.41,0:00:04.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,pray Psalm twenty three,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.15,0:00:06.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,release your unfinished day,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and rest in your Shepherd's care.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.57,0:00:12.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you have reached your pillow
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.23,0:00:14.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a conversation still unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a task still
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.01,0:00:17.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,turning in your mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.75,0:00:20.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring that unfinished day here.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.83,0:00:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your shoulders settle
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.66,0:00:24.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,as comfortably as they can.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to arrange
Dialogue: 4,0:00:26.82,0:00:29.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,a perfect ending before you pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.53,0:00:32.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will walk through Psalm twenty three,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.37,0:00:33.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,one verse at a time,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.79,0:00:35.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,beginning with the One
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.35,0:00:36.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,who cares for you.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.01,0:00:40.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my shepherd;
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.20,0:00:42.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I shall not want.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.58,0:00:43.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.95,0:00:45.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have come to the end
Dialogue: 4,0:00:45.57,0:00:47.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,of what I can do today.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the messages
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.00,0:00:50.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I could not answer,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:50.48,0:00:52.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work I could not finish,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:52.67,0:00:55.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the needs I could not meet.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:55.27,0:00:56.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive me here,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.63,0:00:59.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,with no polished explanation.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.27,0:01:01.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to know your care more
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.62,0:01:04.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,deeply than I know my own worry.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.40,0:01:06.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be my Shepherd in this quiet hour,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.95,0:01:08.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,and teach me how
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,to receive rest from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.41,0:01:13.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have spent today
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.17,0:01:15.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,being useful to other people.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:15.48,0:01:17.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You answered, arranged, carried,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:17.92,0:01:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,remembered.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yet the first verse gives
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.80,0:01:22.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,you an identity that comes
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.74,0:01:24.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,before all of those things.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:24.92,0:01:27.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You belong to a Shepherd.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.02,0:01:29.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your place with him does not disappear
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,when your energy is spent.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.05,0:01:33.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you listen,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.11,0:01:35.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can stop measuring this day
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.46,0:01:37.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,only by what you accomplished.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also remember whose care
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,has accompanied you through it.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am the good shepherd:
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.63,0:01:47.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,the good shepherd giveth
Dialogue: 4,0:01:47.23,0:01:49.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,his life for the sheep.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,These are the words of Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.14,0:01:54.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,His care has a cost
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.61,0:01:56.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,that he willingly bears.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.65,0:01:58.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,When you wonder whether you matter,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.97,0:02:00.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can look toward the cross
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.89,0:02:02.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the love revealed there.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.93,0:02:05.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are listening to a Shepherd
Dialogue: 4,0:02:05.10,0:02:06.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,who gives himself.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is the ground beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.40,0:02:10.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,this evening prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.01,0:02:11.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to produce
Dialogue: 4,0:02:11.88,0:02:14.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,a stronger feeling before you come near.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.93,0:02:16.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring your hesitant
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.92,0:02:18.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,trust to him as it is.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:19.93,0:02:20.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:20.50,0:02:23.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my practical needs before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.76,0:02:26.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the household expenses,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work I am seeking,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the decisions about
Dialogue: 4,0:02:29.95,0:02:31.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I can afford.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.60,0:02:34.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom to distinguish a genuine
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.71,0:02:37.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,need from the pressure to keep up.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to ask for assistance
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.64,0:02:41.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,where I need it and to use
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.46,0:02:43.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I have carefully.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for daily provision,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,honest opportunities,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a heart that can
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.50,0:02:51.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive help without shame.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.03,0:02:52.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.41,0:02:54.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I compare my life
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,with someone else's,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:55.66,0:02:57.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lose sight of the gifts
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.59,0:02:59.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,already beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:59.16,0:03:02.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight I lay down that comparison.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not know their whole story,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:04.70,0:03:07.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I cannot live their calling.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.29,0:03:09.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize the portion
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,entrusted to me today.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let gratitude grow without
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.71,0:03:16.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,denying anything difficult.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.14,0:03:17.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I have enough,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,make me generous.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I am lacking,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me speak honestly
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek wise support.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,He maketh me to lie
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.84,0:03:28.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,down in green pastures:
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.93,0:03:32.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,he leadeth me beside the still waters.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.62,0:03:36.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,The movement of this verse is gentle.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.74,0:03:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are led somewhere nourishing,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.97,0:03:40.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you are allowed
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.26,0:03:41.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,to lie down there.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.66,0:03:44.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,In the picture the psalm gives you,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.10,0:03:47.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,rest belongs within the Shepherd's care.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have learned to treat
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.32,0:03:50.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,every quiet moment as
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.94,0:03:53.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,an opportunity to catch up.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight you can receive
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.93,0:03:56.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,a different invitation.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.85,0:03:59.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your body has limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.04,0:04:01.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can honor those limits without
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.66,0:04:03.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,making tiredness a verdict
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.67,0:04:05.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,on your worth.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.14,0:04:07.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd of my life,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.78,0:04:09.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I set down the tools
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.43,0:04:10.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,of this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the screen, the list,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,the calculations,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.38,0:04:17.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the words I keep rehearsing.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.08,0:04:19.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me the humility to stop
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,when my strength is spent.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.08,0:04:23.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,If something needs attention tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.82,0:04:25.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me return to it
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.26,0:04:26.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,with wisdom then.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.67,0:04:27.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,For this hour,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.85,0:04:30.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my work before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.31,0:04:32.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my hands become quiet,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let my mind step away
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the unfinished page.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.96,0:04:38.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the wish that this
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.46,0:04:42.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,evening had gone differently.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.71,0:04:45.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I hoped for a calmer home,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,more time,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.48,0:04:48.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a kinder conversation.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the evening I actually have.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.79,0:04:53.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet me among the ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.80,0:04:55.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,sounds around me,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,the light beneath the door,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.21,0:05:00.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the things still out of place.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a little room inside
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.33,0:05:05.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,my thoughts to remember your presence.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.44,0:05:08.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive this moment without
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.01,0:05:10.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,demanding that it be perfect.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,For a moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.57,0:05:14.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,leave the list alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.45,0:05:15.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe naturally,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,without trying to reach
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,a particular rhythm.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:19.24,0:05:21.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice where you are supported.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your next breath
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.35,0:05:24.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,arrive in its own time,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,while this simple prayer settles:
Dialogue: 4,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd, lead me into rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:32.72,0:05:35.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,He restoreth my soul:
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.03,0:05:37.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,he leadeth me in the paths
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.07,0:05:40.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,of righteousness for his name's sake.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.66,0:05:44.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Restoration reaches deeper than
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.27,0:05:46.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,recovering enough energy to
Dialogue: 4,0:05:46.54,0:05:47.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,be busy again.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.90,0:05:49.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can ask God to turn
Dialogue: 4,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,your attention back toward
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.45,0:05:53.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,what is true and good.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you recognize a place
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.51,0:05:57.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,where you drifted today,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.41,0:05:58.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,a small compromise
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.83,0:06:01.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a kindness you withheld.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.14,0:06:02.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm joins
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,restoration with guidance.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring that place
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the Shepherd and ask
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.15,0:06:10.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,for a faithful next step.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.10,0:06:11.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to hide
Dialogue: 4,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,it beneath exhaustion.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.96,0:06:15.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:15.36,0:06:18.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name what needs forgiveness in me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:18.44,0:06:20.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember the sharp answer,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,the selfish choice,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the truth I avoided.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.15,0:06:25.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am sorry
Dialogue: 4,0:06:25.01,0:06:27.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the hurt I caused.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.08,0:06:27.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Forgive me,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and make me willing
Dialogue: 4,0:06:29.23,0:06:30.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,to repair what I can.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me distinguish honest
Dialogue: 4,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibility from endless
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.12,0:06:36.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,self-accusation.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.57,0:06:38.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot undo this
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.11,0:06:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,day by replaying it.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.00,0:06:42.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring it to your mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.10,0:06:44.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask you to shape a more
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,faithful response tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:47.54,0:06:50.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide my next step, Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.02,0:06:52.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,If an apology is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me offer it plainly.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,If a boundary is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me speak it with steadiness.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I need to finish
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,something I have avoided,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.17,0:07:04.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me courage to begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.24,0:07:06.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from making grand promises
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.87,0:07:09.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,tonight that I have not considered.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:09.75,0:07:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me the quiet faithfulness
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.00,0:07:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,of doing one right
Dialogue: 4,0:07:13.30,0:07:14.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,thing at a time,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.46,0:07:17.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,following the path you place before me.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall feed his flock
Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.32,0:07:21.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}like a shepherd:
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.66,0:07:22.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall gather
Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.76,0:07:24.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the lambs with his arm,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and carry them in his bosom,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and shall gently lead
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.02,0:07:30.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}those that are with young.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Isaiah gives you another
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,view of the Shepherd.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.15,0:07:37.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some need to be carried;
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,some need to be led gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are allowed to acknowledge which
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.85,0:07:43.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,kind of help you need tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you have been carrying
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibility for others,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,this tenderness includes you.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to walk
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.53,0:07:53.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,at someone else's pace
Dialogue: 4,0:07:53.14,0:07:54.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be worthy of care.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.86,0:07:57.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,The image makes room for weakness,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,for dependence,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and for a slower journey.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.79,0:08:02.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gentle Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.99,0:08:05.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the people who depend
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.17,0:08:06.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,on me and the weariness
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I sometimes hide from them.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.12,0:08:10.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me love them without
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.91,0:08:13.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,pretending my strength is endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me where I can
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.05,0:08:16.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,share a task,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.10,0:08:17.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask a friend,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.15,0:08:20.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,or accept another person's kindness.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.23,0:08:22.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I feel guilty for resting,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me that I am also
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.66,0:08:27.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,a creature in need of care.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.02,0:08:29.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me receive tenderness as
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.30,0:08:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,readily as I try to offer it.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.03,0:08:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yea,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,though I walk through the valley
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.65,0:08:37.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the shadow of death,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.32,0:08:38.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will fear no evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:08:38.95,0:08:41.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art with me;
Dialogue: 5,0:08:41.22,0:08:42.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy rod and thy staff
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.98,0:08:44.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they comfort me.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.99,0:08:48.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,The valley is part of the psalm.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are given words for a place
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.95,0:08:53.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,where the way is difficult to see.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:53.61,0:08:55.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice how the prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.08,0:08:56.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,becomes personal here:
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.79,0:09:00.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the speaker addresses God directly.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can do that too.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can speak to him from
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,the middle of what troubles you,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.92,0:09:07.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you understand it.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,The comfort offered
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,is companionship on the path.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to describe
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,the valley as easy
Dialogue: 4,0:09:15.09,0:09:16.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,to pray with trust.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.90,0:09:18.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.27,0:09:20.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the sorrow that feels
Dialogue: 4,0:09:20.42,0:09:23.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,sharper when the house grows quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the person I miss,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.24,0:09:27.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,the change I did not choose,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.46,0:09:30.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the future that now looks different.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:30.81,0:09:33.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay near as I grieve.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not force a cheerful
Dialogue: 4,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,ending onto a painful day.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the tears I have,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.68,0:09:42.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the words I cannot find.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.23,0:09:44.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me accept companionship
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.25,0:09:46.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,from people who can sit with me
Dialogue: 4,0:09:46.49,0:09:48.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,without rushing my sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.75,0:09:50.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the unknown
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.87,0:09:54.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,that follows me into bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.09,0:09:56.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot see how the conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.72,0:09:58.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,will go or what the next
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.64,0:10:00.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,season will require.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me courage for the part
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,that belongs to me,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:03.77,0:10:06.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,and patience with what remains unclear.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me attentive to wise
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.72,0:10:11.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,counsel and practical help.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.04,0:10:11.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,For tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask you to meet me
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.51,0:10:15.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the uncertainty itself.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.70,0:10:17.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me remember that I can
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,speak to you from here.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.47,0:10:21.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.09,0:10:22.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember those I love
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.68,0:10:24.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,who are walking through
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.28,0:10:25.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,their own valleys.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.70,0:10:28.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot choose their steps
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,or remove every difficulty.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring their names
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you with love.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.94,0:10:36.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give them faithful companions
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.19,0:10:37.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the help their
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.58,0:10:39.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,circumstances require.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:39.47,0:10:42.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to listen before I advise.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me a kindness I can
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.45,0:10:46.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,offer when the day begins.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.59,0:10:47.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I rest now,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.74,0:10:50.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust them to your compassion,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.54,0:10:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,with all that remains beyond my reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.04,0:10:57.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thou preparest a table before me
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.63,0:11:00.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the presence of mine enemies:
Dialogue: 5,0:11:00.40,0:11:03.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou anointest my head with oil;
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.29,0:11:05.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,my cup runneth over.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,The table appears while
Dialogue: 4,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,opposition is still present.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.12,0:11:13.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may recognize that kind
Dialogue: 4,0:11:13.31,0:11:15.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,of unfinished situation:
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.44,0:11:16.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,a disagreement,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,a strained relationship,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.58,0:11:21.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a place where you feel misunderstood.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:21.98,0:11:23.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,The verse lets you picture
Dialogue: 4,0:11:23.78,0:11:26.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,receiving care within that setting.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.38,0:11:28.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can turn your attention
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,toward the Host.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.59,0:11:31.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to spend every
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.97,0:11:33.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,remaining hour making
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.63,0:11:36.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,your case in your imagination.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.19,0:11:38.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is nourishment to receive
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.51,0:11:40.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,even while a difficult
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.16,0:11:42.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,matter remains unresolved.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.48,0:11:43.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.89,0:11:46.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the argument I keep
Dialogue: 4,0:11:46.07,0:11:48.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,conducting in my head.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.04,0:11:51.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have imagined my answers many times,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.29,0:11:52.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I am tired.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:52.76,0:11:54.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me surrender the urge
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.53,0:11:56.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,to win it again tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.35,0:11:59.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom about any conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,that still needs to happen.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.35,0:12:03.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect me from cruelty,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.12,0:12:06.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,and help me keep appropriate boundaries.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:06.25,0:12:08.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a heart that can
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.26,0:12:10.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,seek peace without pretending
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,harm is harmless.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the rehearsed speeches
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.89,0:12:15.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,become quiet now.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.51,0:12:17.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pause over a particular
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.02,0:12:21.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness from this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,A meal prepared,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.27,0:12:23.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,a message received,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.77,0:12:25.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,a moment of laughter,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,or someone making room for me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.99,0:12:30.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the gift I remember.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the person
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,through whom it came.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.66,0:12:36.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me notice ordinary provision while
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.68,0:12:39.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I still live among unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive this small
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.65,0:12:43.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,mercy with gratitude.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let it occupy a little more space
Dialogue: 4,0:12:46.24,0:12:49.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,in my memory than it did before.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.18,0:12:50.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,let what I receive become
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness in my hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.22,0:12:56.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have patience to spare,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me offer it.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.03,0:13:00.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have enough to share,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.10,0:13:02.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice a real need.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.28,0:13:04.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have been forgiven,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.11,0:13:05.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,soften the way I speak
Dialogue: 4,0:13:05.65,0:13:07.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,to someone who has failed.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:07.65,0:13:10.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not want abundance to mean
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,only gathering more for myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Form in me a generous life,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,with room for my neighbor
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the table.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.09,0:13:21.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Surely goodness and mercy shall
Dialogue: 5,0:13:21.64,0:13:23.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}follow me all the
Dialogue: 5,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}days of my life:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.54,0:13:26.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will dwell in the house
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the LORD for ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm ends with a horizon
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,wider than this evening.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.33,0:13:36.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,You began with the needs
Dialogue: 4,0:13:36.21,0:13:37.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,of one day,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.08,0:13:38.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,and now you hear
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.33,0:13:40.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,about all your days.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:40.08,0:13:43.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be able to recognize mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.07,0:13:45.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,in places you once overlooked:
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.89,0:13:47.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,someone staying,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:47.13,0:13:48.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,a chance to begin again,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.99,0:13:52.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,help arriving through an ordinary hand.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:52.20,0:13:55.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hold those memories gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.19,0:13:57.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,They give you reasons to trust
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.34,0:13:59.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Shepherd with a future
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.19,0:14:01.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,you cannot yet describe.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.29,0:14:03.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Faithful Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.41,0:14:06.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place tomorrow within your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:06.31,0:14:09.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot prepare for every possibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:09.27,0:14:11.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I do not need to finish
Dialogue: 4,0:14:11.32,0:14:13.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,tomorrow's prayers tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.55,0:14:14.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,When morning comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:14.96,0:14:17.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide the work and the relationships
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.63,0:14:18.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,waiting there.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:18.85,0:14:21.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize goodness,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.01,0:14:22.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive mercy,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.14,0:14:24.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,and offer both to others.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the remaining
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.02,0:14:28.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,hours of this night to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:28.19,0:14:29.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my life become
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place where I learn,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,day by day,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,to dwell with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.01,0:14:37.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I belong to the good Shepherd.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.43,0:14:40.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring him a genuine need.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.36,0:14:42.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can receive rest without
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,earning it through exhaustion.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can return when I have wandered.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:47.48,0:14:48.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can speak to him
Dialogue: 4,0:14:48.91,0:14:50.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the valley.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:50.20,0:14:52.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can receive kindness
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.07,0:14:54.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,while questions remain.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.20,0:14:56.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the day behind me
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the day before
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,me within his care.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.25,0:14:59.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am learning to trust him
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.76,0:15:03.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,with what I cannot carry.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.98,0:15:06.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Choose one unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,concern from today.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.44,0:15:09.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Name it simply,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:09.64,0:15:12.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,without opening the whole story again.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.87,0:15:14.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then pray:
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.35,0:15:15.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place this in your care
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,for tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.84,0:15:20.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,If a practical step belongs to tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:20.98,0:15:24.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can take it when tomorrow arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.14,0:15:24.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.78,0:15:26.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,let that one concern rest
Dialogue: 4,0:15:26.77,0:15:28.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside this one prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:28.78,0:15:30.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have given it a name,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:30.46,0:15:32.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you have brought it to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.91,0:15:35.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you would like
Dialogue: 4,0:15:35.18,0:15:36.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,to mark that prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.66,0:15:39.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can type amen in the comments.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.36,0:15:42.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,We now move into Scripture for sleep,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,with gentle readings about
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.06,0:15:45.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Shepherd's care.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:46.73,0:15:49.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can leave the screen alone now
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.14,0:15:51.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,and listen with your eyes resting,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.56,0:15:53.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,if that is comfortable.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is nothing you need
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,to remember for a test
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,or prepare to say afterward.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:58.93,0:16:00.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,The words can arrive
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.47,0:16:02.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,one passage at a time.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.35,0:16:04.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your attention wanders,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.61,0:16:06.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,return gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:06.01,0:16:07.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you remain awake,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.60,0:16:09.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have not failed.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:09.37,0:16:11.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is simply a quiet place
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,to rest with Scripture.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.72,0:16:15.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Come unto me,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.67,0:16:16.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all ye that labour
Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.98,0:16:18.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and are heavy laden,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will give you rest.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Take my yoke upon you,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.28,0:16:23.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and learn of me;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.80,0:16:24.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am meek
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.93,0:16:26.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and lowly in heart:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.76,0:16:28.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and ye shall find
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.10,0:16:29.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}rest unto your souls.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.94,0:16:31.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,For my yoke is easy,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:31.65,0:16:33.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my burden is light.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:35.29,0:16:37.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are included in the invitation
Dialogue: 4,0:16:37.89,0:16:39.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you are weary.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:39.59,0:16:41.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to become
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.47,0:16:43.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,less tired before you come.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.68,0:16:45.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the gentleness of Jesus
Dialogue: 4,0:16:45.75,0:16:48.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,be what you notice in these words.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can rest your attention
Dialogue: 4,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,on his character rather than checking
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.75,0:16:55.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,whether you have become calm enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even a distracted prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:16:57.34,0:16:59.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,can be an honest arrival.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:59.64,0:17:00.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are here,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you are welcome
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.01,0:17:03.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,to bring your burden.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:05.24,0:17:05.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:05.68,0:17:07.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the burden of trying
Dialogue: 4,0:17:07.74,0:17:10.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prove that I have done enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:10.35,0:17:11.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask you to teach
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.89,0:17:13.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,me your gentle way.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:13.69,0:17:15.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive the rest
Dialogue: 4,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,you offer to my soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:17.39,0:17:19.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave my unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:17:19.23,0:17:21.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,explanations before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:21.52,0:17:22.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my need
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.68,0:17:25.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be understood in your hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:25.28,0:17:27.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this quiet time become a small
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,practice of trusting your goodness,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.26,0:17:31.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:17:31.49,0:17:33.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,and attention I have tonight.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.26,0:17:38.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For thus saith the Lord GOD;
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Behold, I, even I,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:39.59,0:17:41.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,will both search my sheep,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:41.70,0:17:43.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek them out.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.34,0:17:45.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,As a shepherd seeketh out his flock
Dialogue: 4,0:17:45.66,0:17:47.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the day that he is among
Dialogue: 4,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,his sheep that are scattered;
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.56,0:17:51.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,so will I seek out my sheep,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.44,0:17:53.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and will deliver them out of all
Dialogue: 4,0:17:53.58,0:17:56.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,places where they have been scattered
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the cloudy and dark day.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:59.56,0:18:00.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Through Ezekiel,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.79,0:18:03.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,God speaks to his scattered people.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:03.66,0:18:05.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Shepherd himself takes
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.48,0:18:07.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,the initiative to seek them.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.62,0:18:08.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you listen,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:08.66,0:18:10.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can notice the tenderness
Dialogue: 4,0:18:10.80,0:18:12.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,of that action.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.09,0:18:14.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your thoughts may feel scattered
Dialogue: 4,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,across many unfinished things,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:16.42,0:18:18.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,but you do not need to gather
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.44,0:18:20.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,every one before you pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:20.44,0:18:21.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can ask for help
Dialogue: 4,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,in gathering them.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:23.44,0:18:25.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let your attention settle
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,again on the God
Dialogue: 4,0:18:27.13,0:18:28.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,who seeks his flock.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.32,0:18:32.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Allow a little space between
Dialogue: 4,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,one thought and the next.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can feel the pillow beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:18:36.52,0:18:38.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,you without adjusting anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.96,0:18:41.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in your ordinary way.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:41.61,0:18:43.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,For these few moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:43.29,0:18:45.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,let being here be enough.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.38,0:18:50.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Know ye that the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he is God:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.24,0:18:53.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}it is he that hath made us,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.57,0:18:55.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and not we ourselves;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.56,0:18:56.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}we are his people,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.91,0:18:59.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and the sheep of his pasture.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.26,0:19:02.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Enter into his gates with thanksgiving,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.05,0:19:04.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and into his courts with praise:
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.52,0:19:06.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be thankful unto him,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.27,0:19:08.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and bless his name.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.03,0:19:10.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For the LORD is good;
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.06,0:19:12.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,his mercy is everlasting;
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.70,0:19:14.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,and his truth endureth
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.64,0:19:16.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,to all generations.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:18.00,0:19:20.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,You did not have to make yourself
Dialogue: 4,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you could belong to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:22.68,0:19:25.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your life began as a gift.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,This psalm gives you a way
Dialogue: 4,0:19:27.32,0:19:30.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,to receive that gift with gratitude,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:30.16,0:19:32.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,even after a complicated day.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:32.62,0:19:34.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are part of a people
Dialogue: 4,0:19:34.30,0:19:35.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,who have prayed before
Dialogue: 4,0:19:35.85,0:19:37.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,you and will pray after you.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:37.99,0:19:39.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,In this quiet room,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.46,0:19:42.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,your small prayer joins a much larger
Dialogue: 4,0:19:42.32,0:19:45.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,history of thanksgiving and trust.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:46.62,0:19:47.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Creator,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:47.26,0:19:49.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,thank you for giving me life,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.57,0:19:51.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,and for the ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:19:51.16,0:19:53.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,ways it is sustained.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:53.01,0:19:55.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for water, shelter,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:55.32,0:19:56.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,companionship,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:56.43,0:19:59.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the possibility of beginning again.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.72,0:20:01.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me remain attentive
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.39,0:20:03.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,to those who lack what I can
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.34,0:20:05.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,easily take for granted.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.19,0:20:07.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive my gratitude without
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.72,0:20:10.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,requiring me to deny my sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.70,0:20:13.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Both are here before you tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.00,0:20:14.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I bring them together
Dialogue: 4,0:20:14.74,0:20:16.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,into your presence.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.74,0:20:20.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}That thou mayest say to the prisoners,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.76,0:20:21.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Go forth;
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.65,0:20:23.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to them that are in darkness,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:23.88,0:20:25.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Shew yourselves.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.29,0:20:27.45,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}They shall feed in the ways,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.45,0:20:29.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and their pastures shall
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.30,0:20:31.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be in all high places.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:31.18,0:20:33.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}They shall not hunger nor thirst;
Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.97,0:20:35.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall the heat
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.67,0:20:37.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor sun smite them:
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.32,0:20:38.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for he that hath mercy
Dialogue: 5,0:20:38.97,0:20:40.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}on them shall lead them,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.77,0:20:42.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}even by the springs of water
Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall he guide them.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:46.04,0:20:48.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Isaiah describes a people being
Dialogue: 4,0:20:48.50,0:20:51.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,brought out and led with mercy.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.13,0:20:53.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,The picture carries you toward
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.34,0:20:54.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,pasture and springs,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:54.81,0:20:57.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,toward care along the journey.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:57.20,0:20:58.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let that picture
Dialogue: 4,0:20:58.98,0:21:01.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,rest beside the still waters
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.06,0:21:02.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the psalm we prayed.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to turn it
Dialogue: 4,0:21:04.86,0:21:07.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a prediction about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:07.46,0:21:10.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive its witness to God's
Dialogue: 4,0:21:10.15,0:21:12.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,compassion and ask to recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:21:12.46,0:21:15.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,his guidance in your own next step.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.76,0:21:17.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Merciful God,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:17.85,0:21:21.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep my heart teachable while I wait.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I sometimes want the whole
Dialogue: 4,0:21:23.30,0:21:25.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,road explained before I begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.95,0:21:28.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive the light available
Dialogue: 4,0:21:28.25,0:21:30.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the step in front of me.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lead me through wise counsel,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.53,0:21:33.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,truthful words,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:33.71,0:21:35.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and patient attention.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:35.61,0:21:37.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,As the room grows quieter,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.64,0:21:39.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the demand
Dialogue: 4,0:21:39.21,0:21:41.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,to understand everything tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.97,0:21:43.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for trust that can
Dialogue: 4,0:21:43.91,0:21:45.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,remain honest about
Dialogue: 4,0:21:45.45,0:21:47.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I do not yet know.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.99,0:21:50.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He will not suffer
Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.07,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy foot to be moved:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.07,0:21:55.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth thee will not slumber.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.06,0:21:55.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Behold,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.57,0:21:57.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth Israel shall
Dialogue: 5,0:21:57.58,0:21:59.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither slumber nor sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:01.12,0:22:03.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,You hear the psalm describe
Dialogue: 4,0:22:03.22,0:22:06.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,a Keeper who does not grow drowsy.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.06,0:22:08.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your attention can fade;
Dialogue: 4,0:22:08.37,0:22:11.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,God's faithfulness is not sustained
Dialogue: 4,0:22:11.33,0:22:13.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,by your concentration.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.37,0:22:15.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can stop checking whether
Dialogue: 4,0:22:15.40,0:22:17.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are holding every concern
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.43,0:22:19.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,correctly in prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:19.01,0:22:21.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,The people you love remain known
Dialogue: 4,0:22:21.36,0:22:23.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,to him when you are too tired
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.49,0:22:25.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,to form another sentence.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:25.51,0:22:27.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your own need for sleep
Dialogue: 4,0:22:27.35,0:22:29.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,be something you can acknowledge
Dialogue: 4,0:22:29.54,0:22:31.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,with tenderness tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:32.86,0:22:33.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:33.24,0:22:36.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust this household to your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:36.30,0:22:38.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember each person nearby,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.69,0:22:40.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,and those whose homes
Dialogue: 4,0:22:40.36,0:22:41.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,are far from mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give us patience with one
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.74,0:22:45.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,another's needs.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.05,0:22:47.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grant rest to those who can sleep
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.43,0:22:49.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,and strength to those whose
Dialogue: 4,0:22:49.37,0:22:51.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibilities keep them awake.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:51.93,0:22:54.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where practical help is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.32,0:22:55.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide us toward it.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:55.97,0:22:58.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the wish to supervise
Dialogue: 4,0:22:58.18,0:23:00.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything from this pillow and rest
Dialogue: 4,0:23:00.75,0:23:03.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,my love for them before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.43,0:23:06.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,My sheep hear my voice,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:06.21,0:23:07.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I know them,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.44,0:23:09.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,and they follow me:
Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.09,0:23:12.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And I give unto them eternal life;
Dialogue: 5,0:23:12.02,0:23:14.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and they shall never perish,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:14.06,0:23:15.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall any man
Dialogue: 5,0:23:15.58,0:23:17.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}pluck them out of my hand.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:19.14,0:23:21.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus speaks of knowing his sheep.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:21.88,0:23:25.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can linger with that personal word.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:25.07,0:23:27.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are more than the story
Dialogue: 4,0:23:27.12,0:23:29.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,you managed to explain today,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:29.33,0:23:31.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,more than what someone understood
Dialogue: 4,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,or misunderstood about you.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:34.06,0:23:37.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your prayer can become very simple here.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:37.38,0:23:39.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can rest in being known,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:39.45,0:23:42.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask to recognize the Shepherd's
Dialogue: 4,0:23:42.03,0:23:43.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,voice through his words.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:43.98,0:23:45.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is no need to invent
Dialogue: 4,0:23:45.84,0:23:48.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,a longer speech for this quiet moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:50.23,0:23:50.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:50.71,0:23:52.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am grateful that I do
Dialogue: 4,0:23:52.57,0:23:54.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,not have to explain myself
Dialogue: 4,0:23:54.68,0:23:56.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,endlessly to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:56.23,0:23:58.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know the effort behind this day
Dialogue: 4,0:23:58.87,0:24:02.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the uncertainty beneath my answers.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:02.00,0:24:04.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me follow you with sincerity.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:04.80,0:24:07.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where my understanding is incomplete,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:07.70,0:24:09.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me humble.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:09.06,0:24:11.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where my trust is fragile,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:11.06,0:24:13.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive the little I can offer.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:13.63,0:24:15.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place myself before you,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:15.68,0:24:17.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,known more fully than
Dialogue: 4,0:24:17.34,0:24:18.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can know myself,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:18.75,0:24:21.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and held within your love.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:22.48,0:24:24.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thy mercy, O LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:24.11,0:24:25.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is in the heavens;
Dialogue: 5,0:24:25.92,0:24:27.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and thy faithfulness
Dialogue: 5,0:24:27.48,0:24:29.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}reacheth unto the clouds.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:29.60,0:24:31.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thy righteousness is like
Dialogue: 5,0:24:31.62,0:24:33.41,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the great mountains;
Dialogue: 5,0:24:33.41,0:24:36.15,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy judgments are a great deep:
Dialogue: 5,0:24:36.15,0:24:36.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:36.76,0:24:39.55,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou preservest man and beast.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:39.55,0:24:42.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}How excellent is thy lovingkindness,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:42.92,0:24:43.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O God!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.66,0:24:46.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}therefore the children of men put their
Dialogue: 5,0:24:46.40,0:24:49.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}trust under the shadow of thy wings.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:49.11,0:24:51.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}They shall be abundantly satisfied
Dialogue: 5,0:24:51.56,0:24:53.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}with the fatness of thy house;
Dialogue: 5,0:24:53.90,0:24:56.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and thou shalt make them drink
Dialogue: 5,0:24:56.04,0:24:58.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the river of thy pleasures.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:58.36,0:24:59.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For with thee
Dialogue: 5,0:24:59.40,0:25:01.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is the fountain of life:
Dialogue: 5,0:25:01.49,0:25:04.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in thy light shall we see light.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:05.49,0:25:08.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,The images widen around you:
Dialogue: 4,0:25:08.36,0:25:10.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,heavens, clouds, mountains,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:10.59,0:25:11.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,deep water.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:11.68,0:25:14.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the psalm brings you close beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:25:14.53,0:25:17.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,a sheltering wing and beside a fountain.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:17.64,0:25:20.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can imagine receiving what you could
Dialogue: 4,0:25:20.59,0:25:22.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,never produce by effort alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:22.98,0:25:23.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:23.57,0:25:25.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,you do not need to generate
Dialogue: 4,0:25:25.56,0:25:27.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,all your own strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:27.36,0:25:30.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can ask, receive, and rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:30.12,0:25:32.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the scale of this picture make
Dialogue: 4,0:25:32.36,0:25:34.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,a little space around the concerns
Dialogue: 4,0:25:34.59,0:25:37.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,that have filled your attention.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:38.38,0:25:41.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice the quietest sound around you.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:41.33,0:25:43.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to follow it.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:43.92,0:25:45.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your hands remain where
Dialogue: 4,0:25:45.73,0:25:47.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,they are comfortable,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:47.15,0:25:49.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and allow your breathing its own pace.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:49.88,0:25:51.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,The next words are simple
Dialogue: 4,0:25:51.84,0:25:54.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,words for the end of a day.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:57.14,0:25:58.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will both lay
Dialogue: 4,0:25:58.35,0:25:59.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,me down in peace,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:59.74,0:26:00.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,and sleep:
Dialogue: 5,0:26:00.73,0:26:02.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou, LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:26:02.06,0:26:05.15,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}only makest me dwell in safety.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:06.48,0:26:08.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive these words as
Dialogue: 4,0:26:08.60,0:26:10.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,a prayer from your own pillow.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:10.89,0:26:12.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to force
Dialogue: 4,0:26:12.67,0:26:14.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,a particular feeling while
Dialogue: 4,0:26:14.60,0:26:15.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,you hear them.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:15.82,0:26:18.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some evenings become quiet quickly;
Dialogue: 4,0:26:18.71,0:26:20.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,others take longer.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:20.68,0:26:21.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:21.55,0:26:23.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can bring yourself
Dialogue: 4,0:26:23.28,0:26:25.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,to God without criticism.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:25.43,0:26:27.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the verse give you language
Dialogue: 4,0:26:27.74,0:26:29.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,for what you desire:
Dialogue: 4,0:26:29.41,0:26:31.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,a peaceful lying down,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:31.23,0:26:32.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,a trusting heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:32.64,0:26:34.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,and rest received
Dialogue: 4,0:26:34.05,0:26:36.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,with gratitude when it comes.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:38.13,0:26:40.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,I laid me down and slept;
Dialogue: 4,0:26:40.63,0:26:42.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,I awaked;
Dialogue: 5,0:26:42.16,0:26:44.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:46.04,0:26:49.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,These words look back with gratitude.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:49.03,0:26:51.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may remember an ordinary morning
Dialogue: 4,0:26:51.80,0:26:53.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,when you opened your eyes
Dialogue: 4,0:26:53.72,0:26:54.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,and began again,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:54.95,0:26:57.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,perhaps without noticing the gift.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:57.74,0:27:01.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now you can receive that memory gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:01.25,0:27:03.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,There have been nights you did
Dialogue: 4,0:27:03.33,0:27:05.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,not manage perfectly and mornings
Dialogue: 4,0:27:05.61,0:27:07.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,you still met with help.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:07.45,0:27:10.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can place this night among them,
Dialogue: 4,0:27:10.18,0:27:12.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,asking for sustaining grace
Dialogue: 4,0:27:12.22,0:27:14.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,without needing to know every
Dialogue: 4,0:27:14.42,0:27:16.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,detail of what comes next.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:18.07,0:27:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,My Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:27:19.00,0:27:21.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave this day with you now.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:21.51,0:27:22.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the gratitude,
Dialogue: 4,0:27:22.99,0:27:24.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,the confession, the sorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:27:24.80,0:27:26.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the hope I have brought.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:26.85,0:27:27.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grant me rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:27:27.92,0:27:29.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,and meet me with patience
Dialogue: 4,0:27:29.83,0:27:31.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,if I am still awake.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:31.54,0:27:33.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive the care
Dialogue: 4,0:27:33.33,0:27:34.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,available to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:34.70,0:27:36.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the next breath
Dialogue: 4,0:27:36.55,0:27:39.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the coming morning to your mercy.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:39.47,0:27:40.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have no further
Dialogue: 4,0:27:40.90,0:27:42.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,words I need to add.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:42.76,0:27:43.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,I rest before
Dialogue: 4,0:27:43.85,0:27:46.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,you in the name of Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:46.12,0:27:47.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:49.00,0:27:51.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,May the gentleness of the good
Dialogue: 4,0:27:51.24,0:27:53.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd accompany your rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:53.59,0:27:56.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,May his mercy quiet the harsh words
Dialogue: 4,0:27:56.27,0:27:58.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have spoken against yourself.
Dialogue: 4,0:27:58.98,0:28:01.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,May his presence be your comfort
Dialogue: 4,0:28:01.37,0:28:02.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the hours ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:02.98,0:28:05.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,The prayer is complete.
Dialogue: 4,0:28:05.08,0:28:05.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest here,
Dialogue: 4,0:28:05.85,0:28:08.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,with this day entrusted to his care.
